msgid ""
"If no working CANN environment is available, first install the CANN version "
"that matches both the target hardware and the software stack on this page."
msgstr "如果没有可用的 CANN 环境，需要先安装与目标硬件和本页软件配套一致的 CANN。"

msgid "Open the following official resources:"
msgstr "先打开以下官方入口："

msgid ""
"- [CANN Community Edition Download Center](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\n"
"    - [CANN Software Installation Guide](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/900/softwareinst/instg/instg_0000.html)"
msgstr ""
"- [CANN Community Edition 下载中心](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)\n"
"    - [CANN 软件安装指南](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/900/softwareinst/instg/instg_0000.html)"

msgid ""
"Based on `{{ release_cann_version }}`, the target hardware, CPU "
"architecture, and operating system, obtain the following three types of "
"`.run` installer:"
msgstr ""
"按 `{{ release_cann_version }}`、目标硬件、CPU 架构和操作系统准备三类 `.run`\n"
"    安装包："

msgid ""
"- CANN Toolkit;\n"
"    - the operator package for the target hardware;\n"
"    - an NNAL package at the same version as the other two packages."
msgstr ""
"- CANN Toolkit；\n"
"    - 目标硬件对应的 operator package；\n"
"    - 与前两者版本一致的 NNAL package。"

msgid "!!! important \"Confirm NNAL separately\""
msgstr "!!! important \"NNAL 需要单独确认\""

msgid ""
"The download page or quick installation path may primarily display the "
"Toolkit and operator package, without placing NNAL in the same prominent "
"location. vLLM Ascend requires NNAL/ATB at runtime. Do not skip NNAL simply "
"because the Toolkit installation succeeded."
msgstr ""
"下载页或快速安装路径有时主要展示 Toolkit 和算子包，不一定把 NNAL 放在\n"
"        同一个显眼入口。vLLM Ascend 运行依赖 NNAL/ATB；不能因为 Toolkit 安装成功\n"
"        就跳过 NNAL。"

msgid ""
"The NNAL `.run` package is typically named `Ascend-cann-nnal_...run`. For installation options, refer to the\n"
"        [CANN installation parameter reference](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/CANNCommunityEdition/900/softwareinst/instg/instg_0043.html)."
msgstr ""
"NNAL `.run` 包通常以 `Ascend-cann-nnal_...run` 命名。安装参数可参考\n"
"        [CANN 安装参数说明](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/CANNCommunityEdition/900/softwareinst/instg/instg_0043.html)。"

msgid "!!! important \"Do not reuse operator packages across hardware products\""
msgstr "!!! important \"不要跨硬件复用 operator package\""

msgid ""
"Atlas A2, Atlas A3, Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro, and Atlas 950DT must "
"use their respective matching operator packages. All three package types "
"must use the same CANN version."
msgstr ""
"Atlas A2、Atlas A3、Atlas 300I DUO / Atlas 200I Pro 和 Atlas 950DT\n"
"        必须选择各自匹配的 operator package。三类软件包的 CANN 版本必须一致。"

msgid ""
"After downloading the packages, replace the following three variables with "
"the absolute paths to the actual files, then run the installation commands:"
msgstr "下载完成后，把下面三个变量替换为实际文件的绝对路径，再执行安装："

msgid "After installation, load and check the Toolkit and NNAL:"
msgstr "安装完成后加载并检查 Toolkit 和 NNAL："

msgid ""
"If you use a non-default installation path, load the `set_env.sh` from the "
"corresponding location. If the NNAL check fails, install the matching NNAL "
"version before continuing with the vLLM Ascend installation."
msgstr ""
"如果使用非默认安装路径，请加载对应路径下的 `set_env.sh`。如果 NNAL 检查失败，\n"
"    先补齐同版本 NNAL，不要继续安装 vLLM Ascend。"

msgid "??? tip \"CANN package download fails\""
msgstr "??? tip \"CANN package 下载失败\""

msgid ""
"Check the network, proxy/mirror, and disk space in the download environment."
" Also reconfirm the CANN version, hardware package, and CPU architecture."
msgstr ""
"检查下载环境的网络、proxy/mirror 和磁盘空间，并再次确认 CANN version、\n"
"        hardware package 与 CPU architecture。"

msgid "??? note \"Conda CANN\""
msgstr "??? note \"Conda CANN\""

msgid ""
"If you use CANN Conda packages released by Huawei, follow the complete Conda"
" installation process. Mixing a Conda Toolkit with `.run` operator/NNAL "
"installation methods is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 Huawei 发布的 CANN Conda packages，应完整遵循 Conda 安装流程，\n"
"        不建议把 Conda Toolkit 与 `.run` operator/NNAL 安装方式混合。"
